ource\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>, despite the two conditions having different effects.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 358px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 356px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"3d model by Bert Vanhengel and François Debrabandere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg/534px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg/800px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg/1067px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"3d model by Bert Vanhengel and François Debrabandere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg/534px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-06.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">3d model by Bert Vanhengel and François Debrabandere</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 171.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 169.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wavemothers_cloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Wavemothers_cloak.png/254px-Wavemothers_cloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Wa